    "content": "<p>Look alive, Pilots! Time to upgrade your Hangar with a <strong>full mixed War Robot Build</strong>&mdash;just for logging in and playing!&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Play one battle across seven out of 14 days from <strong>April 8 (10:00 CEST/01:00 PST) to April 22 (10:00 CEST/01:00 PST) </strong>to earn rewards:&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n\t<li>Day 1: <strong>1x Minefield </strong>(Cycle Gear)</li>\r\n\t<li>Day 2: <strong>2x Pulsars</strong> (Weapons)</li>\r\n\t<li>Day 3: <strong>1x Lancelot </strong>(Chassis Module)</li>\r\n\t<li>Day 4: <strong>1x Orochi + 1x Bulwark </strong>(Shoulder Modules)</li>\r\n\t<li>Day 5: <strong>1x Sprint Reactor</strong> (Supply Gear)</li>\r\n\t<li>Day 6: <strong>1x Fury </strong>(Torso Module)</li>\r\n\t<li>Day 7: <strong>1x&nbsp;</strong><strong>Dragoon </strong>(Weapon)</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://static-eu.prod-my.games/chronos-public-eu-wrf-prod/site/2025/04/195-LoginEvent/1.png\" /></strong></p>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"important-text important-text--icon important-text--color_special\">\r\n<div class=\"important-text__inner\">\r\n<div class=\"important-text__icon\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"important-text__text\">\r\n<p><strong>IMPORTANT</strong>: You must have completed your Training Battles to participate in the Battle Bonus Event.&nbsp;</p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<hr />\r\n<p><strong>Download War Robots: Frontiers for free today:</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://warrobotsfrontiers.com/l/playstation\"><strong>PlayStation&reg;5</strong></a><strong>│</strong><a href=\"https://warrobotsfrontiers.com/l/playstation\"><strong>PlayStation&reg;4</strong></a><strong>│ </strong><a href=\"https://warrobotsfrontiers.com/l/xbox\"><strong>Xbox Series X|S&trade;</strong></a><strong> │</strong><a href=\"https://warrobotsfrontiers.com/l/xbox\"><strong>Xbox One&trade;</strong></a></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a 